==Battleground==
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Osamu Mikumo & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**2 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage. Stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] to win. If you own [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], use him to nuke the boss even faster.

